   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# AI_Employment_Regression.ipynb\n",
    "\n",
    "## AI 對就業影響 — OLS Regression Model (Python)\n",
    "\n",
    "PolyU AF5641 Econometrics | Week 11 | 2026年6月\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 研究問題\n",
    "\n",
    "**研究問題：**\n",
    "- AI 投資、自動化、互聯網普及率、教育水平如何影響就業增長？\n",
    "- 假設：\n",
    "  - H1: AI 投資 ↑ 就業 ↑ (技術紅利)\n",
    "  - H2: 自動化 ↑ 就業 ↓ (取代效應)\n",
    "  - H3: 互聯網普及 ↑ 就業 ↑ (數字經濟)\n",
    "  - H4: 教育水平 ↑ 就業 ↑ (高技能需求)\n",
    "\n",
    "**模型：**\n",
    "```\n",
    "Employment_Growth = β₀ + β₁·AI_Investment + β₂·Automation_Rate + β₃·Internet_Pen + β₄·Education + ε\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 數據準備\n",
    "\n",
    "用模擬數據示範（實際可從 World Bank / OECD 取得）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import statsmodels.api as sm\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.rcParams['figure.figsize'] = (10, 6)\n",
    "sns.set_style('whitegrid')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 模擬數據（50 個國家）\n",
    "np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "n = 50\n",
    "\n",
    "data = {\n",
    "    'Country': [f'Country_{i}' for i in range(1, n+1)],\n",
    "    'AI_Investment_USD_B': np.random.uniform(0.1, 50, n),\n",
    "    'Automation_Rate_Pct': np.random.uniform(10, 80, n),\n",
    "    'Internet_Penetration_Pct': np.random.uniform(50, 99, n),\n",
    "    'Education_Index': np.random.uniform(0.5, 0.95, n),\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "df = pd.DataFrame(data)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 生成依變量：就業增長率\n",
    "df['Employment_Growth_Pct'] = (\n",
    "    0.05 * df['AI_Investment_USD_B']\n",
    "    - 0.03 * df['Automation_Rate_Pct']\n",
    "    + 0.02 * df['Internet_Penetration_Pct']\n",
    "    + 0.5 * df['Education_Index']\n",
    "    + np.random.normal(0, 1, n)\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(df.head(10))\n",
    "print(f'\\n數據形狀: {df.shape}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 探索性數據分析 (EDA)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(df.describe())\n",
    "print('\\n========== 相關性分析 ==========')\n",
    "print(df[['AI_Investment_USD_B', 'Automation_Rate_Pct', \n",
    "          'Internet_Penetration_Pct', 'Education_Index',\n",
    "          'Employment_Growth_Pct']].corr())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 散佈圖矩陣\n",
    "sns.pairplot(df[['AI_Investment_USD_B', 'Automation_Rate_Pct', \n",
    "                  'Internet_Penetration_Pct', 'Education_Index',\n",
    "                  'Employment_Growth_Pct']], \n",
    "             diag_kind='kde', \n",
    "             plot_kws={'alpha': 0.6})\n",
    "plt.suptitle('Scatter Plot Matrix', y=1.02)\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. OLS Regression"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "X = df[['AI_Investment_USD_B', 'Automation_Rate_Pct', \n",
    "        'Internet_Penetration_Pct', 'Education_Index']]\n",
    "y = df['Employment_Growth_Pct']\n",
    "X = sm.add_constant(X)\n",
    "\n",
    "model = sm.OLS(y, X).fit()\n",
    "print(model.summary())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. 模型診斷"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from statsmodels.stats.outliers_influence import variance_inflation_factor\n",
    "\n",
    "# VIF 檢測多重共線性\n",
    "vif = pd.DataFrame()\n",
    "vif['Variable'] = X.columns\n",
    "vif['VIF'] = [variance_inflation_factor(X.values, i) for i in range(X.shape[1])]\n",
    "print('========== VIF (多重共線性) ==========')\n",
    "print(vif)\n",
    "print('\\nVIF > 10 表示嚴重多重共線性')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 殘差分析\n",
    "residuals = model.resid\n",
    "fitted = model.fittedvalues\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 3, figsize=(18, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Q-Q Plot\n",
    "sm.qqplot(residuals, line='45', ax=axes[0])\n",
    "axes[0].set_title('Q-Q Plot')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 殘差 vs 擬合值\n",
    "axes[1].scatter(fitted, residuals)\n",
    "axes[1].axhline(y=0, color='r', linestyle='--')\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel('Fitted Values')\n",
    "axes[1].set_ylabel('Residuals')\n",
    "axes[1].set_title('Residuals vs Fitted')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 殘差分佈\n",
    "axes[2].hist(residuals, bins=15, edgecolor='black')\n",
    "axes[2].set_xlabel('Residuals')\n",
    "axes[2].set_ylabel('Frequency')\n",
    "axes[2].set_title('Residuals Distribution')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Breusch-Pagan Test (同方差性)\n",
    "from statsmodels.stats.diagnostic import het_breuschpagan\n",
    "\n",
    "bp_test = het_breuschpagan(residuals, X)\n",
    "print('========== Breusch-Pagan Test ==========')\n",
    "print(f'Lagrange Multiplier: {bp_test[0]:.4f}')\n",
    "print(f'p-value: {bp_test[1]:.4f}')\n",
    "print('p-value > 0.05 表示同方差性假設成立')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Durbin-Watson (自相關)\n",
    "from statsmodels.stats.stattools import durbin_watson\n",
    "dw = durbin_watson(residuals)\n",
    "print(f'\\n========== Durbin-Watson ==========')\n",
    "print(f'DW = {dw:.4f}')\n",
    "print('DW ≈ 2 表示無自相關')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. 預測 + 視覺化"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df['Predicted'] = model.predict(X)\n",
    "df['Residual'] = model.resid\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(16, 6))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Actual vs Predicted\n",
    "axes[0].scatter(df['Employment_Growth_Pct'], df['Predicted'], alpha=0.6)\n",
    "axes[0].plot([df['Employment_Growth_Pct'].min(), df['Employment_Growth_Pct'].max()],\n",
    "              [df['Employment_Growth_Pct'].min(), df['Employment_Growth_Pct'].max()],\n",
    "              'r--', lw=2)\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel('Actual Employment Growth (%)')\n",
    "axes[0].set_ylabel('Predicted Employment Growth (%)')\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(f'Actual vs Predicted (R² = {model.rsquared:.3f})')\n",
    "\n",
    # 係數圖\n",
    "coef_df = pd.DataFrame({\n",
    "    'Variable': X.columns[1:],\n",
    "    'Coefficient': model.params[1:],\n",
    "    'PValue': model.pvalues[1:]\n",
    "})\n",
    "colors = ['green' if p < 0.05 else 'red' for p in coef_df['PValue']]\n",
    "axes[1].barh(coef_df['Variable'], coef_df['Coefficient'], color=colors, alpha=0.7)\n",
    "axes[1].axvline(x=0, color='black', linestyle='--')\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel('Coefficient')\n",
    "axes[1].set_title('Regression Coefficients (Green = p<0.05)')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. 結果總結\n",
    "\n",
